# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl SHOULD be committed for reproducible provider versions.

# Secrets / keys — never commit these
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*.ppk

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
*.swp
